That's him, she confirmed. Her abductor had been found walking the street close by and was charged with assault with a deadly weapon. He maintained that he had no recollection of the event. In a pretrial bail hearing, counsel for the defense successfully depicted their client as a hard-working and well-respected church-going family man. He was released on $2,000 bail pending a trial that was scheduled to begin in January the following year. But by late December, the man was prowling the streets of Anchorage once again, looking for his next target. In the early morning hours of Sunday December 19, Gemma Gibbs rushed across a parking lot and into the warmth of a nearby cafe. The 18-year-old was in desperate need of a hot drink to ward off Anchorage's icy winter.
是他，她确认道。她的绑架者被发现在附近的街道上闲逛，并被控持致命武器攻击罪。他坚持说自己对该事件毫无记忆。在审前保释听证会上，辩护律师成功地将他们的客户描绘成一个勤劳、备受尊敬且经常去教堂的顾家好男人。他以2,000美元保释金获释，等待定于次年1月开始的审判。但到了12月下旬，这名男子再次在安克雷奇的街头徘徊，寻找他的下一个目标。12月19日星期日的清晨，杰玛·吉布斯快步穿过停车场，走进了附近一家咖啡馆的温暖中。这位18岁的姑娘急需一杯热饮来驱散安克雷奇冰冷的冬日。

