After ordering a tea, Gemma headed back outside to start the heater in her car so it would be toasty for the drive home. While doing so, she saw a silver blue Pontiac pull into a neighboring parking spot. A man emerged from the vehicle, but she paid him little attention. Once her car heater was blasting, Gemma returned to the cafe to collect her order. The male driver of the Pontiac was standing by the cafe door as if waiting for her. When Gemma approached, he blocked her path and attempted to start a conversation. It seemed like he was going to ask her something, but a stutter got the better of him and he struggled to form the words. Gemma tried to push past him, but froze when he pulled out a gun from underneath his coat.
点了一杯茶后，杰玛转身回到外面去发动汽车上的加热器，这样开车回家时就会很暖和。在此期间，她看到一辆银蓝色庞蒂克轿车开进了相邻的停车位。一名男子从车里出来，但她没有怎么注意他。当她的汽车暖气开到最大时，杰玛回到咖啡馆去取她的订单。庞蒂克的男司机正站在咖啡馆门口，仿佛在等她。当杰玛走近时，他挡住了她的去路并试图搭话。看起来他想问她点什么，但结巴让他说不出话来，他努力想组织语言。杰玛试图挤过他，但当他从外套底下掏出一把枪时，她吓僵了。

